<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <div class="legal-page">
    <button type="button" class="legal-back" data-legal-back>&larr; Back</button>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %></p>

    <p>
      At Kalpavruksha Kalyana, we value your privacy and are committed to protecting your
      personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and safeguard
      your information when you use our matrimony platform.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect the following information during registration or while using our services:</p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Personal Information</strong>
          <ul class="legal-sublist">
            <li>Name, mobile number, and email address.</li>
            <li>Username and password (stored in an encrypted, non-readable form).</li>
            <li>Date of birth, age, gender, and marital status.</li>
            <li>Photographs and horoscope or jathaka documents you choose to upload.</li>
            <li>Height, weight, complexion, and physical or health details you provide.</li>
            <li>Education, occupation, income, and employment details.</li>
            <li>Religion, caste, community, and horoscope or family details.</li>
            <li>Family background, native place, and preferences you share about a partner.</li>
            <li>Messages, interests, and any other information you send us through the platform.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Technical Information</strong>
          <ul class="legal-sublist">
            <li>Your IP address and approximate location derived from it.</li>
            <li>Your browser type, version, and device information.</li>
            <li>Pages viewed, the pages you navigated from, and the approximate time and duration of your visit.</li>
            <li>Referring pages, search terms used to reach the site, and browser/device identifiers.</li>
            <li>Error logs and diagnostic data used to keep the site secure and working.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>Your information is used to:</p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Create and manage your profile</li>
        <li>Display your profile to other members based on your privacy settings</li>
        <li>Suggest compatible matches</li>
        <li>Verify your account</li>
        <li>Provide customer support</li>
        <li>Improve our services</li>
        <li>Send service-related notifications</li>
        <li>Comply with applicable legal requirements</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties.</p>
      <p>
        Your profile information may be visible to other registered members according to your
        privacy settings.
      </p>
      <p>We may share information:</p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>When required by law or a legal authority.</li>
        <li>To protect our rights, users, or the public.</li>
        <li>With trusted service providers who assist in operating our platform (subject to confidentiality obligations).</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. Profile Visibility</h2>
      <p>
        By creating a profile, you understand that certain profile details may be visible to other
        registered members based on your selected privacy settings.
      </p>
      <p>You are responsible for deciding what information you choose to share.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We use reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational measures to help protect
        your personal information from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction.
      </p>
      <p>
        However, no website or online transmission is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee
        absolute security.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. User Responsibility</h2>
      <p>You are responsible for:</p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Keeping your login credentials confidential.</li>
        <li>Verifying the identity and information of other members before sharing personal or financial information.</li>
        <li>Exercising caution while communicating with other users.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
      <p>Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to:</p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Remember your preferences.</li>
        <li>Improve website performance.</li>
        <li>Analyze website traffic.</li>
        <li>Enhance your browsing experience.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You may disable cookies through your browser settings, although some features of the
        website may not function properly.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can accept all cookies or continue with essential cookies only using the consent banner
        shown on your first visit. To change your choice at any time, use the "Cookie Settings"
        link in the footer. Full details are available in our <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>8. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites or services.</p>
      <p>
        We are not responsible for the privacy practices, content, or policies of those third-party
        websites.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our services are intended only for individuals who are legally eligible to marry under
        applicable law.
      </p>
      <p>We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>10. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain your information only for as long as necessary to:</p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Provide our services.</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations.</li>
        <li>Resolve disputes.</li>
        <li>Enforce our agreements.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        After account deletion, certain information may be retained where required by law or for
        legitimate business purposes.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>11. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Subject to applicable law, you may:</p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>Access your personal information.</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your account.</li>
        <li>Manage your privacy settings.</li>
        <li>Contact us regarding your personal data.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>12. Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        While we strive to protect your information, we cannot guarantee the accuracy of
        information provided by other users or the actions of third parties.
      </p>
      <p>
        Users should independently verify all details before making any personal or matrimonial
        decisions.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>13. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.</p>
      <p>
        Any changes will be posted on this page with the revised effective date. Continued use of
        the website after such changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Privacy Policy.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

  <%- include('partials/legal-back-script') %>
</body>
</html>
